  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(229, 229, 229);&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of scale, siting, design, bulk, mass and appearance would be an undesirable addition,&amp;nbsp;representing an overly dominant and excessive addition to the dwelling. The side extension would be significantly visible from public vantage points and would be visually intrusive, represent poor design and would be out of character in the context of the area.&amp;nbsp; The addition of the loft extension combined with the addition of the side extension will result in overdevelopment of the site.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;-\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework &lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- The Residential\r\nExtensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: &quot; pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;-\r\nPolicies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of &lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and\r\nDagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (